### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### USERS API — ManagerOrAdmin (roles/tenant-aware)
### ============================================================

### List all users (legacy, non-paged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/
Cookie: {{token}}

### List users paged + search (QUERY — new)
QUERY {{baseUrl}}/api/users/paged
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "searchTerm": "admin",
  "pageNumber": 1,
  "pageSize": 20
}

### Get user by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test",
  "middleName": "",
  "lastName": "User",
  "userName": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123456",
  "identification": "123456789",
  "identificationTypeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "tenantId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020"
}

### Update a user (password nullable — send null or "**********" to keep)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Updated",
  "middleName": "",
  "lastName": "User",
  "userName": "testuser",
  "email": "updateduser@example.com",
  "password": null,
  "identification": "123456789",
  "identificationTypeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "tenantId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020"
}

### Update a user — change password
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Updated",
  "middleName": "",
  "lastName": "User",
  "userName": "testuser",
  "email": "updateduser@example.com",
  "password": "NewPass@123456",
  "identification": "123456789",
  "identificationTypeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "tenantId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020"
}

### Delete a user (soft-delete → IsActive=false)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Deactivate a user (explicit soft-delete)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/deactivate
Cookie: {{token}}

### Activate a deactivated user (bypasses query filter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/activate
Cookie: {{token}}

### Update user roles (replace full set)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
  "roleIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000100", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101"]
}

### Lock user (blocks login, distinct from deactivation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/lock
Cookie: {{token}}

### Unlock user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/unlock
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get users by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/Teacher/by-role?tenantId=01a01c0d-1bfb-7e56-a50c-58a4602473e5
Cookie: {{token}}
